      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Are you able to rename the post title? I clicked on \"So simple but so useful!\" expecting to read a very poorly thought out and impossible to implement idea to... Laugh at but not comment on.\n\nBut this is actually a good idea.\n\nSofter kick - kick AFK users without 1 hour block\n\nIf someone is on stage and they crash, soft kick would also be useful here instead of having to choose to wait for VRChat to realize they're gone or have them gone for an hour.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
