  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-06-28T13:10:52.238Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Problem- friend afks for an unknown amount of time and you want to move on, but you don't want to leave their body unattended. but you can't kick them or they can't rejoin for maybe an 30 mins to an hour.\n\nSolution- A soft kick. This allows someone to return back to the world right away once they get back.\n\nThis came about when hosting a party two times and people went to the bathroom and because they took so long people thought they fell asleep and so we kicked only to have them come back as we kicked. F 😆 so we has to remake the whole world just to get them back in. \n\nAnd just recently I had an event where someone got sick and their friend stepped away from vr to look after them and make sure they are okay. Well, several friends thought they were asleep because they were away too long. And I almost kicked them, fortunately they got back just in time to let me know what was going on, but had I kicked them they practically would have been punished for looking after their sick friend.",
